  "description": "SSRS Report Definition Language (.rdl) export for DocWright: turns a document into a Reporting Services report template — page setup, Tablix tables, embedded images, and merge fields bound as =Fields!Name.Value dataset expressions — for RDL 2016/01 (default) and 2010/01. Produces a report definition to deploy, not a rendered report. Export only. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
